  m_text: '1. Take the order at the counter.   2. Put ingredients in a bowl and hold E to mix.   3. Bake the dough.   4. Serve it!


    Grab it from the oven right when it dings for a PERFECT bake and a bigger tip. Wait too long and it burns.

    The faster you serve, the more they tip. Keep 3+ customers happy in a row for a streak bonus.

    Customers getting grumpy? Pet Biscuit the cat. Everyone loves Biscuit.'
